  subtitles:
  - startTime: 0
    endTime: 2
    text: 'Bamboo needs water to grow, '
  - startTime: 2
    endTime: 4
    text: 'and there is enough water here.  '
  - startTime: 4
    endTime: 6.5
    text: 'But a panda eats huge amounts, and the '
  - startTime: 6.5
    endTime: 9
    text: 'bamboo is being eaten faster than it grows. '
  - startTime: 9
    endTime: 11.5
    text: 'Pandas follow the bamboo and travel up  '
  - startTime: 11.5
    endTime: 14
    text: and down the mountains throughout the year.
